  "releaseNotes": "## [2.2.11] - 2026-09-22\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- *(deployment)* Execute import materialization and tighten planning contracts\n- *(deployment)* Ignore OS metadata files in source projection\n- *(deployment)* Align metadata ownership without a manifest\n\n### 💼 Other\n\n- Fix(deployment): harden projection manifest recovery\n\n### 🚜 Refactor\n\n- *(deployment)* Separate target planning from execution\n- *(deployment)* Tighten target diff and execution boundaries\n- *(deployment)* Share projection arbitration\n\n### 📚 Documentation\n\n- *(cli)* Correct home selection to TRIDENT_HOME\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
